Well, people have given you sensible answers, so I will give you some 
silly (but still working) ones.

> - Is there an easy way to destroy boulders? I often find myself with
> no choice but to push them in front of me and end up blocking my path
> to the next level.

Magically turn them into giant chunks of meat (optionally, eat them).
Turn into a giant and pick them up.
Turn into a lithovore and eat them.
Polymorph them (erm, maybe; the source suggests you can't do this actually).
Push them into a pit or hole.
Cause something else in the dungeon to do one of the above.

> Also, are there any ways to light up dark rooms?

Any creature that emits light will light up a 3x3-square region around 
itself.  These are:
   * black/yellow lights
   * flaming/shocking spheres
   * fire vortices
   * and fire elementals
Placing lots of lit lamps and candles around will light the place up 
quite nicely.

